{
  "$comment": [
    "Copy for the neofetch-style info card (output/info-card.svg).",
    "Edit freely: build.py re-renders the card from this file every run.",
    "",
    "Keep this honest. Everything here is a public claim about a real person,",
    "so prefer a {placeholder} backed by live GitHub data over a hand-written",
    "line that sounds good but cannot be checked.",
    "",
    "Row types:",
    "  kv     — white label in the left column, green value in the right",
    "  bullet — blue marker followed by white text",
    "  text   — plain white text, no marker",
    "  rule   — a full-width cyan separator",
    "  blank  — reserves one empty line",
    "",
    "Placeholders are substituted from live GitHub data at build time:",
    "  {login} {name} {tagline} {bio} {company} {location}",
    "  {repos} {followers} {following} {stars} {member_since} {account_age}",
    "  {top_language} {languages} {language_list}",
    "  {contributions} {active_days} {longest_streak} {current_streak} {busiest_day}",
    "  {today} {year} {data_source}"
  ],
  "sections": [
    {
      "title": "ABOUT",
      "rows": [
        { "type": "kv", "label": "name", "value": "Rohit Dastidar" },
        { "type": "kv", "label": "user", "value": "{login}@github" },
        { "type": "kv", "label": "host", "value": "github.com" },
        { "type": "kv", "label": "uptime", "value": "{account_age} since {member_since}" },
        { "type": "kv", "label": "repositories", "value": "{repos} public" },
        { "type": "kv", "label": "languages", "value": "{language_list}" },
        { "type": "kv", "label": "focus", "value": "cloud infrastructure · devops" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "STACK",
      "rows": [
        { "type": "bullet", "value": "Python · automation · tooling" },
        { "type": "bullet", "value": "Azure · AKS · Azure DevOps" },
        { "type": "bullet", "value": "Kubernetes · containers" },
        { "type": "bullet", "value": "Docker · image builds" },
        { "type": "bullet", "value": "CI/CD pipelines" },
        { "type": "bullet", "value": "GitHub Actions · workflows" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "HIGHLIGHTS",
      "rows": [
        { "type": "kv", "label": "contributions", "value": "{contributions}" },
        { "type": "kv", "label": "active days", "value": "{active_days}" },
        { "type": "kv", "label": "longest streak", "value": "{longest_streak}" },
        { "type": "kv", "label": "current streak", "value": "{current_streak}" },
        { "type": "kv", "label": "public repos", "value": "{repos}" },
        { "type": "kv", "label": "stars earned", "value": "{stars}" }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
